### Step 8 - Out-of-stock flow
# Product C has zero stock; checkout must be rejected.

GET {{baseUrl}}/carts/current?customerId={{outOfStockCustomerId}}

> {%
    client.global.set("outOfStockCartId", response.body.id);
%}

### Add the out-of-stock product
POST {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{outOfStockCartId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{outOfStockProductId}}",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Start checkout
POST {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{outOfStockCartId}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "TRY"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("outOfStockOrderId", response.body.orderId);
%}

### After Kafka: expected REJECTED order
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{outOfStockOrderId}}

### After Kafka: expected ACTIVE cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/carts/{{outOfStockCartId}}
